maa aun-o-mohd ki hu'n zainab hai mera naam<br>
taqdeer ki maari hu'n mai hu'n zainab-e-nakaam<br>
<br>
ye dono pisar saath me laayi hu'n watan se <br>
bhai pa mere dono ko qurbaan mai karke <br>
lashou pe baja laaungi mai shukr ka sajda<br>
<br>
hai meri wasiyat jo tum maqtal ko sidharo <br>
darya ki taraf rukh bhi na karna mere pyaro <br>
tum ban ke yaha'n aaye ho maa baap ka fidya<br>
<br>
maidaan ki ijazat me kyu'n ta'qeer hai beta <br>
qurbaniye awwal me rahe naam tumhara <br>
dekhu'n mai sabhi khoon se tar dono ka lasha<br>
<br>
lo paake ijazaat chale zainab ke dulare <br>
ladte bhi kaha'n tak the wo seh roz ke pyase <br>
maqtal se sada aaqri di ya shahe wala<br>
<br>
jab sunke sada run ko chale sarwar-e-aalam <br>
aaye jo nazar lashe to karne lage matam <br>
aankhou'n se rawa'n ashkou ka hone laga dariya<br>
<br>
khaime me chale aaye wo sar apna jhukaye <br>
zainab se kaha laal tere leke hum aaye <br>
godi me liye lashou'n ko karte rahe girya<br>
<br>
tan aun-o-mohd ke sab zakhmou se saje the <br>
the choor sabhi pasliyaa'n abru bhi kate the <br>
saidaaniya'n sar peet ke kehti thi khudara<br>
<br>
allah kisi maa ko ye manzar na dikhaye <br>
koi na sohail istarha se daagh uthaye <br>
jis tarha se zainab ka huwa qalb shikasta